# 9. TAHAP KEENAM — GOOGLE CLOUD STORAGE

Pertahankan:
`server/services/gcsStorageService.ts`

Gunakan Google Cloud Storage sebagai permanent object storage.

Pastikan:
- Source videos disimpan di GCS.
- Render outputs disimpan di GCS.
- Thumbnail disimpan di GCS.
- Intro assets disimpan di GCS.
